From c2167a0423615f0de76ec2aeb3c770424a16e662 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cptmeme <61885007+Cptmeme@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:01:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add Nanoleaf Shapes (LeafBus) LED output type

New bus type TYPE_LEAFBUS (72) for Nanoleaf Shapes panels on a single-wire
1 Mbaud UART behind tri-state buffers (ESP32 family only):
- background task: auto-enumeration, C0 polling, hot-plug re-enumeration
- one RGBW pixel per panel, in layout-string order
- automatic 2D ledmap from the panel geometry, on the Shapes panel lattice
  (16.75 x 19.34 mm), rotatable in the output's text field
- settings page: TX/RX pin labels, colour order and skip hidden

Also fix bufToString() in wled_metadata.cpp: it terminated the copied
release name at the end of the buffer, so stack garbage made OTA release
name checks fail.

platformio_override.ini adds esp32c5_nanoleaf for the Nanoleaf Shapes
interface board (ESPC5-12, panels on GPIO26/27, DIO flash).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
